You receive 6 gold pieces.

== Personal Notes ==

''I have completed this quest 10 times now as a lvl 3 from just buying weapons off of merchants and turning them in. The merchants at the lifts are loaded. Even after buying all the weapons, you still make profit after the turn in and selling the reward (Buying as a Wood Elf Druid in Kelethin). With under 6g you can buy all 4 weapons needed for the quest. The turn in gives you 6g and a weapon that sells for 1.9 gold. On top of that, the 10 turn ins gave me just under 1.5 bubbles of exp I beleive. I was doing 2 turn ins at a time due to bag space and weight. Its not to bad of a quest if you're new and looking for a little extra spell money.''

